    "describe_ch": "This course focuses on electronic measurement, circuit modeling, simulation and design techniques. Including transistor amplifiers, motor control, and operational amplifier internals. Finally, the course ends with a two-week group design project. In many ways, this course is the laboratory of the co-requisite lecture course Electrical Engineering Fundamentals II, students are expected to learn and demonstrate material not taught in other courses.\r\n",
